# Localhost Component Master Audit System (ABSOLUTE P0 · LEVEL 20)

## Absolute

All audits on **`http://localhost:3000` ONLY**.  
Certify **real product only** — not SSOT, rules, engines, docs, assumptions.

Forbidden: Preview/Production certification · auto deploy/commit/push · auto login/passwords.

## Per component (5 / 5 required)

1. REAL UI · 2. REAL UX · 3. REAL FUNCTIONAL · 4. REAL RESPONSIVE · 5. REAL PRODUCTION POLISH  

No component certified until **5/5**. No page until all components. No module until all pages. No deployment until **100/100**.

## Fail

1 cropped/overflow/alignment/invisible button/responsive/API/perf/loading/financial/security/nav/duplication issue → **FAIL**.

## Order

Root cause → Fix → Component → Page → Module → Localhost certified only → Owner review → approvals for Commit → Push → Preview → Production.

1 FAIL = FAIL. 1 component FAIL = page FAIL = module FAIL = Deployment Denied.
